<title>USA: US spot MTBE hammered down by NYMEX gasoline.</title>
<headline>US spot MTBE hammered down by NYMEX gasoline.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cts/Gallon  Prompt(Mar)	Any (Apr)	03/13/97(Ppt Mar)</p>
<p>Houston     77.50/78.75 N    77.00/78.00     79.25/79.75</p>
<p>New York    81.25/82.50	83.25/83.50 N   82.50/82.75</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Spot MTBE prices were knocked down this week by the sudden downturn in NYMEX gasoline futures on Wednesday in pre-holiday jitters.</p>
<p>&quot;We got hammered by the gasoline prices yesterday,&quot; said a Houston-based MTBE producer on Thursday.</p>
<p>Most of March MTBE was considered completed, especially since markets will be closed Friday for the Easter holiday.</p>
